{"id":3101,"name":"Video Senshi Lezarion","slug":"video_senshi_lezarion","synopsis":"Takashi Katori is a big fan of online games, and so is his American friend Sarah. However, one of their RPGs goes too far, as their virtual world and the Lezarion robot that Takashi created for the game somehow mix with reality. Takashi is caught, but later the Earth Governement discovers that an evil scientist from the Moon (now a sort of abandoned colony with restricted access) is hacking into virtual worlds and security, so they force Takashi to pilot the Lezarion and, with Sarah's help, fight evil and protect the Earth. \n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":1984,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:47","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 09:18:40","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":6672},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":6672},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":4657},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":1934},{"site":"ANN","externalId":1440},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":7670}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":6187,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/tqXI6itSDp4oxqtFUkdhZS3bpRR4ieV5YojMIvPs.jpg"},{"id":6188,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/Jpk02Awe2ys57ov07QNqXeAZW7G5qkoVJCWHhTZp.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":38,"name":"Toei Animation","slug":"toei_animation"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":480,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":480,"title":"Video Senshi Lezarion","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":529,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":12812,"basename":"VideoSenshiLezarion-OP1.webm","filename":"VideoSenshiLezarion-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/VideoSenshiLezarion-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":25093473,"resolution":480,"nc":false,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"NONE","source":"BD","tags":"BD480","audio":{"id":10684,"basename":"VideoSenshiLezarion-OP1.ogg","filename":"VideoSenshiLezarion-OP1","link":"https://a.anime